Establish `hω' : IsWeilDatumO ψ (sgn ε M) X χS χT (WRep.toSgn ε ω)` using `hω`. Establish `hψ` using `hω'.std`. Establish `h1g : ∀ (g : GA D X), WRep.toSgn ε ω (1, g) = ω (1, g)` using `fun g => by`. Simplify using `[WRep.toSgn]`. Establish `hlin : ptF (V` using `sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ (∑ τ, GlobalTheory.RealQuot.actT ε A B eS τ (L τ).1 P) = ∑ τ, ptF (V := sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ (GlobalTheory.RealQuot.actT ε A B eS τ (L τ).1 P) := map_sum _ _ _`.

Break down `isEmpty_or_nonempty D.what₂.Tau with hT | ⟨⟨τ₀⟩⟩` into its components or cases. Establish `e : ∀ t : ℝ, t • L = L` using `fun t => funext fun τ => (IsEmpty.false τ).elim`. Simplify using `only [e, hlin, Finset.univ_eq_empty, Finset.sum_empty, Pi.zero_apply]`. Conclude with `hasDerivAt_const _ _`. Establish `hth : ∀ Q, IsThetaFunO ψ (sgn ε M) X (ptF (V` using `sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ Q) := (GlobalTheory.LieScalar.ptF_laws hθ hψ (frSgn ε A) B hf).1 τ₀`.

Set `𝒮 : Set (GA D X → ℂ)` to `{φ | ∃ f z, IsThetaFunO ψ (sgn ε M) X f ∧ φ = fun g => WRep.toSgn ε ω (1, g) f z}`. Establish `hc : ∀ φ ∈ 𝒮, Continuous φ`. Introduce and unpack `_ ⟨f, z, hf, rfl⟩`. Conclude with `(hω'.om_cont f hf z).comp (continuous_const.prodMk continuous_id)`. Establish `hd : ∀ φ ∈ 𝒮, ∀ τ', ∀ Z ∈ lieAt X τ', ∃ φ' ∈ 𝒮, ∀ g, HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => φ (g * oneP θ X τ' Z t)) (φ' g) 0`.

Introduce and unpack `_ ⟨f, z, hf, rfl⟩ τ' Z hZ`. Take `⟨G, hG', h⟩` from `GlobalTheory.LieScalar.genT hθ hω' τ' Z hZ f hf`. Use `⟨_, ⟨G, z, hG', rfl⟩, fun g => ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Use `h (MonoidHom.inr (GA D (sgn ε M)) (GA D X) g) z` as an intermediate fact. Simplify `this` using `only [MonoidHom.inr_apply, Prod.mk_mul_mk, mul_one]`.

Set `φ : GA D X → ℂ` to `fun g => WRep.toSgn ε ω (1, g) (ptF (V := sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ P) z`. Establish `hφ : φ ∈ 𝒮` using `⟨_, z, hth P, rfl⟩`. Establish `h1` using `GlobalTheory.Mem.DerClosed.mem_smFun_of_closed D θ hθ X 𝒮 hc hd φ hφ`. Establish `h2 : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.Sm (GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X) φ` using `(GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.isSmoothInf_iff φ).1 ((GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.smooth_iff R φ).1 h1)`. Establish `h3` using `((h2 1).differentiable (by simp) 0).hasFDerivAt`.

