Establish `h3' : HasFDerivAt (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) (fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0) ((0 : ℝ) • V)`. Rewrite using `[zero_smul]`. Conclude with `h3`. Establish `h5` using `HasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt (0 : ℝ) h3' h4`. Simplify `h5` using `only [Function.comp_def, one_mul]`.

Establish `hτ : ∀ τ, fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0 (Pi.single τ (L τ) : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X) = ptF (V` using `sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ (GlobalTheory.RealQuot.actT ε A B eS τ (L τ).1 P) z := by`. Introduce `τ`. Establish `hl` using `(GlobalTheory.LieScalar.lieFockAll D (sgn ε M) X (frSgn ε A) B θ ψ χS χT (WRep.toSgn ε ω) f₀ τ (eS τ) (eT τ) hθ hω' (hexp τ).1 (hexp τ).2 hf).2 (L τ).1 (L τ).2 P z`. Establish `e` using `(hline (Pi.single τ (L τ) : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X)).unique (hl.congr_of_eventuallyEq (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t => by show φ _ = _`. Simplify using `only [φ]`.

Rewrite using `[GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.oneP_eq R τ (L τ) t]`. Use the proof step `rfl))`. Rewrite using `[e]`. Both sides reduce to the same expression. Establish `hsum : ∑ τ, (Pi.single τ (L τ) : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X) = L` using `Finset.univ_sum_single L`.

Establish `e1 : (fun t : ℝ => ω (1, GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X (t • L)) (ptF (V` using `sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ P) z) = fun t => φ (GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X (t • L)) := funext fun t => by simp only [φ, h1g]`. Rewrite using `[e1, hlin, Finset.sum_apply]`. Establish `e2 : fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0 L = ∑ τ, ptF (V` using `sgn ε M) ψ θ (frSgn ε A) B f₀ (GlobalTheory.RealQuot.actT ε A B eS τ (L τ).1 P) z := by`. Establish `h7` using `map_sum (fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0) (fun τ => (Pi.single τ (L τ) : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X)) Finset.univ`. Establish `h8 : fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0 L = fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0 (∑ τ, (Pi.single τ (L τ) : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X))`.

Use `congr 1`. Conclude with `hsum.symm`. Establish `h9 : fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0 L = ∑ τ, fderiv ℝ (fun Y : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X => φ (1 * GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.expInf θ X Y)) 0 (Pi.single τ (L τ) : GlobalTheory.SmoothForms.LieN X)`. Conclude with `h8.trans h7`. Rewrite using `[h9]`.

Conclude with `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun τ _ => hτ τ`. Establish `h6` using `hline L`. Rewrite `h6` using `[e2]`. Then use the resulting hypothesis.
